LICENSE — PLACEHOLDER (private repository)

Status: private, not distributed. Ratified before any publication.

Somatriq intends a noncommercial source-available license compatible with the
restrictions inherited from NOOP. The NOOP license inventory (ADR 0004) is a
required M0 deliverable; until it is complete and a license is ratified:

- This repository must remain private.
- No redistribution, no public forks, no publishing of derived builds.
- NOOP attribution obligations remain in force regardless (see NOTICE and
  ATTRIBUTION.md).

Decision record: docs/grill/2026-09-04-spec-grill.md, decision 5 ("Private for
now").
